WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.400
Point it at a Markdown folder and you get a map.

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.400
Click one concept and only what connects to it stays.

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.400
The same folder reads as prose in the library.

4
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.400
The workshop is where meaning gets filled in.

5
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.400
Fill one blank and the map gains a line.

6
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.400
Insights show what the graph says on its own.

7
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.400
Projects show what is covered and what is empty.

8
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.200
All one folder. No backend, no login.
